<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-gaosengzhuan" book-id="b-gaosengzhuan-010" chapter-id="c-gaosengzhuan-010-baozhi-wangyun" source-id="s-gaosengzhuan-010-baozhi-wangyun-cbeta2026r2">
  <p id="c-gaosengzhuan-010-baozhi-wangyun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">釋<persName id="c-gaosengzhuan-010-baozhi-wangyun:p001:m0001" ref="bpy_73i_0yy">保誌</persName>，本姓朱，金城人。</p>
  <p id="c-gaosengzhuan-010-baozhi-wangyun:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-gaosengzhuan-010-baozhi-wangyun:p002:m0000" ref="bpy_73i_0yy">誌</persName>知名顯奇四十餘載，士女恭事者數不可稱。至天監十三年冬，於臺後堂謂人曰：「菩薩將去。」未及旬日，無疾而終。屍骸香軟，形貌熙悅。臨亡然一燭，以付後閣舍人<persName id="c-gaosengzhuan-010-baozhi-wangyun:p002:m0075" ref="en2_l97_t8b">吳慶</persName>。<persName id="c-gaosengzhuan-010-baozhi-wangyun:p002:m0078" ref="en2_l97_t8b">慶</persName>即啟聞。上歎曰：「大師不復留矣。燭者，將以後事屬我乎？」因厚加殯送，葬于鍾山獨龍之阜。仍於墓所立開善精舍。勅<persName id="c-gaosengzhuan-010-baozhi-wangyun:p002:m0133" ref="war_qdw_fs5">陸倕</persName>製銘辭於塚內，<persName id="c-gaosengzhuan-010-baozhi-wangyun:p002:m0142" ref="mxz_qw8_acd_A">王筠</persName>勒碑文於寺門。傳其遺像，處處存焉。</p>
</text>
